{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/536450/extras/7015b03f2f5b933f4c83825924d6d8e0.avif?t=1726410065\" width=509 height=80 /></span><br>Vzerthos is a 2D isometric old-school techno-fantasy styled Top-Down Shooter. Player's arsenal includes skills of the Thunder God's heir and three types of guns - use them to slice and dice, burn and blow up your enemies!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/536450/extras/257c5d99c6bb24960672245ac4e7d2bb.avif?t=1726410065\" width=509 height=80 /></span><br>Hero under the player's control must rescue a kidnapped princess <i>Se'Vera</i> from the evil Baron <i>Vakhzon</i>.<br>Not only the guards of Baron attack <i>Vzerthos</i>, but his ally <i>Messenger</i> took his magical powers by order of the <i>Thunder God</i>.<br>Now the heir should return his power, to break into Vakhzon castle and rescue the princess!<br><strong>(Princess is exactly in this castle!)</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/536450/extras/11342e8d4833adc6de77db41185ebcbd.avif?t=1726410065\" width=509 height=80 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Graphical style<br>\tAccording to the canons of the old school - isometric graphics pre-render low-poly models and hand drawn visuals construct a unique graphical style.<br><br></li><li> Comics-cutscenes<br>\tGame story is told through small and simple comics.<br><br></li><li> Ability to customize the interface for yourself!<br>\tYou can define an individual and user-friendly interface for yourself using a special text file! You can change not only the position of the elements, but also the visual components!<br><br></li><li> Open localization<br>\tIf you notice an error or don't like the translation, you can easily open a text file with localization and replace the text! This will make translation better, or even create a new language for the game!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"9db2c2e4b01547bfc7aadd65ac15ef2cd6b7f4c4.jpg","localized_name":"The Heir of Thunder!","name":"The Heir of Thunder!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/536450/9db2c2e4b01547bfc7aadd65ac15ef2cd6b7f4c4.jpg"},{"icon":"b5311552d90a6a0403455d01201a8c29eba10c88.jpg","localized_name":"This is Madness!","name":"This is Madness!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/536450/b5311552d90a6a0403455d01201a8c29eba10c88.jpg"},{"icon":"d1da334944b87c86af4b181e1b6f29793ecbb218.jpg","localized_name":"Act I","name":"Act I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/536450/d1da334944b87c86af4b181e1b6f29793ecbb218.jpg"},{"icon":"64d144380fbcaaf21d3f8c1f6bc0be6585b7fe41.jpg","localized_name":"Act II","name":"Act II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/536450/64d144380fbcaaf21d3f8c1f6bc0be6585b7fe41.jpg"},{"icon":"81cd8714af03ade5ef1933de60e5b0ca7c7375b6.jpg","localized_name":"Act III","name":"Act III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/536450/81cd8714af03ade5ef1933de60e5b0ca7c7375b6.jpg"},{"icon":"237cc3a8b6a064b2dfa82432a39c1282a44b739d.jpg","localized_name":"Give me my power back!","name":"Give me my power back!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/536450/237cc3a8b6a064b2dfa82432a39c1282a44b739d.jpg"},{"icon":"840ff809ca5da316fa520099bab7d31dff8eba0e.jpg","localized_name":"Do not stand in my way!","name":"Do not stand in my way!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/536450/840ff809ca5da316fa520099bab7d31dff8eba0e.jpg"},{"icon":"29485185cde5db28b2280c8bb2e5d9c1949b6149.jpg","localized_name":"Broken gears","name":"Broken gears","path":"https://cd